      "mojo_requires": ">=1.0.0",
      "deps": [],
      "changelog": "No SIGPIPE on closed peers; sends complete or raise; full RFC 6890 SSRF ranges plus IPv6; IPv6 and fallback across resolved addresses; connect timeout works on macOS; sockets close themselves when destroyed (breaking: hand the fd over with detach()). Requires requests >= 1.4.0, websocket >= 1.3.0, pg >= 1.7.0."
    },
