      "mojo_requires": ">=1.0.0",
      "deps": [],
      "changelog": "Receives ~4.5x faster (recv_bytes 1.6 -> 7+ GB/s); recv_bytes_exact no longer reserves server-supplied lengths up front and one recv() is at most 1 MiB; timeout_secs bounds the whole connect across all addresses; huge timeouts no longer overflow."
